"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0120","start":120,"end":124,"surface":"昭明太子","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0129","start":129,"end":130,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"vjm_s6i_nh9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"蕭琛","kind":"person","person_id":"m5h_0x9_uxb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"傅昭","kind":"person","person_id":"jmo_mhy_5mr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"陸杲","kind":"person","person_id":"t6x_0wm_0k5_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0158","start":158,"end":159,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0159","start":159,"end":160,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"vjm_s6i_nh9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0239","start":239,"end":240,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"vjm_s6i_nh9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0244","start":244,"end":245,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0287","start":287,"end":291,"surface":"昭明太子","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_s3x_wb4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0298","start":298,"end":300,"surface":"蔡氏","kind":"person","person_id":"sjk_oz2_3e2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete:p002:m0307","start":307,"end":308,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"d5x_77n_qxq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-027","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete-ws1511478"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004","text":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天《宋史》，未及成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《宋書》旣行，子野更刪撰爲《宋略》二十卷。其敘事評論多善，約見而歎曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛、北地傅昭、汝南周捨咸稱重之。至是，吏部尚書徐勉言之於高祖，以爲著作郎，掌國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直正員郎，著作、舍人如故。又敕掌中書詔誥。是時西北徼外有白題及滑國，遣使由岷山道入貢。此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔《注》云：『白題，胡名也。』又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰《方國使圖》，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至于海表，凡二十國。","source_position":{"start":1016,"end":1322,"raw":"　　初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天《宋史》，未及成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《[[宋書]]》旣行，子野更刪撰爲《宋略》二十卷。其敘事評論多善，約見而歎曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛、北地傅昭、汝南周捨咸稱重之。至是，吏部尚書徐勉言之於高祖，以爲著作郎，掌國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直正員郎，著作、舍人如故。又敕掌中書詔誥。是時西北徼外有白題及滑國，遣使由岷山道入貢。此二國歷代弗賓，莫知所出。子野曰：「漢潁陰侯斬胡白題將一人。服虔《注》云：『白題，胡名也。』又漢定遠侯擊虜，八滑從之，此其後乎。」時人服其博識。敕仍使撰《方國使圖》，廣述懷來之盛，自要服至于海表，凡二十國。","