te":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"傅昭","kind":"person","person_id":"jmo_mhy_5mr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"周捨","kind":"person","person_id":"tyk_15n_8t3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁廷太子詹事，與南史周舍同事件；不套漢文周舍或趙簡子周舍。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"徐勉","kind":"person","person_id":"r9i_hp1_yo6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"整篇梁廷高祖；與宋064高祖不是同人，採作品和本傳事件上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0215","start":215,"end":219,"surface":"漢潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"現有史記095p029與此引文同斬胡白題將事件，可回溯灌嬰本傳，不只依爵名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0220","start":220,"end":224,"surface":"胡白題將","kind":"person","person_id":"3ul_r7s_sou","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"引用漢事的一位將領；不當白題國，也不把白題解為已確定個人諱。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"服虔","kind":"person","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0244","start":244,"end":248,"surface":"漢定遠侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"後漢047明班超封定遠侯，後漢088八滑擊北虜事件之將卻為班勇；銜/事件衝突未解，不任連班超、不造第三人。","candidate_person_ids":[]},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"八滑","kind":"person","person_id":"h8q_tj4_cxf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"後漢088明勇率加特奴及八滑、八滑為後部親漢侯，同一擊北虜事件；梁之滑國後裔僅推測，不能建祖系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002","text":"天監十二年，改造太極殿畢，規獻新殿賦，其辭甚工。後為晉安王綱雲麾諮議參軍，久之，為新安太守。父憂去職，服闋，襲封南昌縣侯。除中書黃門侍郎，敕與陳郡殷芸、琅邪王錫、范陽張緬同侍東宮，俱為昭明太子所禮。湘東王繹時為丹陽尹，與朝士宴集，屬規為酒令。規從容曰：「江左以來，未有茲舉。」特進蕭琛、金紫光祿大夫傅昭在坐，並謂為知言。朱異嘗因酒卿規，規責以無禮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":13,"end":14,"surface":"規","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0013","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作規。"},{"start":29,"end":30,"surface":"綱","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0029","person_id":"rtd_v0b_nyn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作綱。"},{"start":73,"end":75,"surface":"殷芸","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0073","person_id":"8d4_fth_d4l","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作芸。"},{"start":78,"end":80,"surface":"王錫","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0078","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作錫。"},{"start":83,"end":85,"surface":"張緬","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0083","person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作緬。"},{"start":102,"end":103,"surface":"繹","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0102","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作繹。"},{"start":110,"end":112,"surface":"朝士","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:u0110","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"宴集群體未具名。"},{"start":116,"end":117,"surface":"規","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0116","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作規。"},{"start":121,"end":122,"surface":"規","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0121","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作規。"},{"start":140,"end":142,"surface":"蕭琛","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0140","person_id":"m5h_0x9_uxb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作琛。"},{"start":149,"end":151,"surface":"傅昭","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0149","person_id":"jmo_mhy_5mr","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作昭。"},{"start":160,"end":162,"surface":"朱異","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0160","person_id":"4nv_kdx_8z9","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作朱。"},{"start":166,"end":167,"surface":"規","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0166","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作規。"},{"start":168,"end":169,"surface":"規","id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui:p002:m0168","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作規。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1477957,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":5574,"raw_end":5748,"raw_character_offsets":[5574,5575,5576,5577,5578,5579,5580,5581,5582,5583,5584,5585,5586,5587,5588,5589,5590,5591,5592,5593,5594,5595,5596,5597,5598,5599,5600,5601,5602,5603,5604,5605,5606,5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618,5619,5620,5621,5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638,5639,5640,5641,5642,5643,5644,5645,5646,5647,5648,5649,5650,5651,5652,5653,5654,5655,5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,5663,5664,5665,5666,5667,5668,5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686,5687,5688,5689,5690,5691,5692,5693,5694,5695,5696,5697,5698,5699,5700,5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706,5707,5708,5709,5710,5711,5712,5713,5714,5715,5716,5717,5718,5719,5720,5721,5722,5723,5724,5725,5726,5727,5728,5729,5730,5731,5732,5733,5734,5735,5736,5737,5738,5739,5740,5741,5742,5743,5744,5745,5746,5747],"projection_sha256":"3f47b3a846644547e4f93db76a358698e31551b481075a9fff832a9500130628"},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wanggui","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wanggui-ws1477957"},{"text":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天宋史，未成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《宋書》稱「松之已後無聞焉」。子野更撰為《宋略》二十卷，其敘事評論多善，而云：「戮淮南太守沈璞，以其不從義師故也」。約懼，徒跣謝之，請兩釋焉。歎其述作曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛言其評論可與過秦、王命分路揚鑣。於是吏部尚書徐勉言之于武帝，以為著作郎，掌修國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直員外，著作、舍人如故。敕又掌中書詔誥。","source_position":{"start":10542,"end":10760,"raw":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天宋史，未成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《[[宋書]]》稱「松之已後無聞焉」。子野更撰為《宋略》二十卷，其敘事評論多善，而云：「戮淮南太守沈璞，以其不從義師故也」。約懼，徒跣謝之，請兩釋焉。歎其述作曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛言其評論可與過秦、王命分路揚鑣。於是吏部尚書徐勉言之于武帝，以為著作郎，掌修國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直員外，著作、舍人如故。敕又掌中書詔誥。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"裴松之字世期、祖昧父珪、注陳壽三國志及子駰，與宋064同組識別特徵。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"何承天","kind":"person","person_id":"92h_l93_ixy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"松之受命續何承天國史、未成而卒；宋064與梁030同一續宋史事，何承天為先修史者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"沈約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"裴松之字世期、祖昧父珪、注陳壽三國志及子駰，與宋064同組識別特徵。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"沈璞","kind":"person","person_id":"xjp_yek_myy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野宋略所論被戮的淮南太守沈璞，暫以人名與官名識別，不從評論推死年或罪事真偽。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"xjp_yek_myy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野宋略所論被戮的淮南太守沈璞，暫以人名與官名識別，不從評論推死年或罪事真偽。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"蕭琛","kind":"person","person_id":"m5h_0x9_uxb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"蘭陵蕭琛稱子野評論與過秦王命比，梁030同地望同文評。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"徐勉","kind":"person","person_id":"r9i_hp1_yo6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吏部尚書薦子野掌國史，後與周舍劉之遴觀移魏文；梁030同薦舉和文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁天監起用、普通移魏文、中大通贈諡等子野朝事，梁030相同事稱高祖；不是齊永明武帝。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-027","source_id":"s-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete-ws1511478","source":{"title":"梁書卷二十七·到洽","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511478","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511478","revision_id":1511478,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"梁書卷二十七·到洽","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"source-evidence/nanshi019-xietiao/liangshu027-ws1511478.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"fcb730ce00423c60dc63e01c4a6d43ecd45cf2669df595850e0abb2339acfb5f"}},{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-027","source_id":"s-liangshu-027-luxiang-complete-ws1511478","source":{"title":"梁書卷二十七·陸襄與鄱陽、吳郡諸人","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511478","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1511478","revision_id":1511478,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url